  "content": "<ul>\n<li>实际上与动漫几乎没有关系。这只是一个适合单人游玩或与朋友一起玩的有趣整合包。</li>\n<li></li>\n<li></li>\n<li></li>\n<li></li>\n<li>这个整合包包含大量科技模组和少量魔法模组，供你随意探索。如果你需要暂时远离机器和仪式，不妨出去探索各种随机生成的结构和地牢。使用匠魂（Tinker's Construct）制作你专属的工具，并通过神秘农业（Mystical Agriculture）种植所需的一切物资。这个整合包基本上涵盖了你想要的所有内容。现在出发，开始你的世界征服之旅吧。</li>\n<li></li>\n<li></li>\n<li>模组列表：</li>\n<li></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/224472\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleCore (by squeek502)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/240630\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Resources (JER) (by way2muchnoise)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/238403\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Builder's Wands (by Portablejim)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/253449\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hwyla (by TehNut)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/311378\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project EX (by LatvianModder)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/242872\" rel=\"nofollow\">Potion Core (by Tmtravlr)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/256247\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystical Agradditions (by BlakeBr0)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/251792\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Jetpacks 2 (by Tomson124)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/248453\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shadowfacts' Forgelin (by ShadowfactsDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/228404\" rel=\"nofollow\">Actually Additions (by Ellpeck)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/237875\" rel=\"nofollow\">Colossal Chests (by kroeser)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/254032\" rel=\"nofollow\">Long Fall Boots (by Nano_Heart)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/225635\" rel=\"nofollow\">AgriCraft (by InfinityRaider)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mod